1
00:00:00,645 --> 00:00:01,915
(Raj:)What should I do?

2
00:00:01,913 --> 00:00:03,283
(Penny:)Okay, answer it.
Just be strong.

3
00:00:03,281 --> 00:00:05,111
(Penny:)And if she starts to cry,
don't make any promises.

4
00:00:05,116 --> 00:00:08,346
(Penny:)And most importantly, put it
on speaker so we can hear.

5
00:00:10,488 --> 00:00:11,818
(Raj:)Hello?

6
00:00:11,822 --> 00:00:13,292
(Emily(voice):)Hey, it's Emily.

7
00:00:13,291 --> 00:00:14,561
(Emily(voice):)Is this a good time?

8
00:00:16,827 --> 00:00:18,597
(Raj:)Yeah, yeah. Sure. What's up?

9
00:00:18,596 --> 00:00:20,826
(Emily:)Was it okay I left that gift?

10
00:00:20,831 --> 00:00:23,501
(Emily:)I'm really hoping
we can be friends.

11
00:00:26,504 --> 00:00:28,974
(Raj:)Maybe, maybe.

12
00:00:28,973 --> 00:00:32,843
(Emily:)Um, you think you'd want
to grab a cup of coffee?

13
00:00:43,154 --> 00:00:44,884
(Raj:)Hello?

14
00:00:44,889 --> 00:00:48,459
(Raj:)I'm sorry, I seem to be taking
an annoying amount of time

15
00:00:48,459 --> 00:00:50,589
deciding how I feel about this!

16
00:00:51,896 --> 00:00:54,926
(Emily:)I just...
I miss hanging out with you.

17
00:00:54,932 --> 00:00:58,772
(Emily:)It's not like I lost a friend,
it's like I lost my best friend.

18
00:00:58,769 --> 00:01:01,299
(choking up):
Is there any chance

